### Claude Code — per-machine agent settings. Scoped to settings.local.json, not the whole ###
### directory: settings.json is the shareable counterpart a future change may want tracked. ###
.claude/settings.local.json

### Git worktrees — a checkout here is a second working copy of this repo (its own build ###
### output and node_modules included), never content this repo should carry.              ###
.worktrees/

### Neon CLI ###
.neon
/ski-resorts-data/

### Local file-backed H2 (application-local profile) ###
/data/

### Node tooling (packages/) ###
packages/**/node_modules/
packages/**/dist/

### Playwright CLI local state (browser e2e tier) ###
.playwright-cli/

### Promptfoo working files — the JSON Schema is regenerated from src/schema.ts on ###
### every run, so a committed copy could only ever be a stale second source.       ###
packages/**/promptfoo/generated/
.promptfoo/

### Code-reviewer artifacts — unanchored: --out defaults to the process cwd, ###
### so these land wherever the CLI is invoked from, not just in the package.  ###
review.json
review.md
### Deliberately retained evidence is the exception. A change's baseline and verification ###
### runs are committed proof a plan reads back later, not incidental run output.          ###
!context/changes/**/review.json
!context/changes/**/review.md
!context/archive/**/review.json
!context/archive/**/review.md

### Secrets — any dotenv file, at any depth ###
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
